OL,3,GNEWSASki centre expected to reopen
OL,4,Abefore end of year
OL,5,
OL,6,FA revamped alpine snow sports centre in
OL,7,FSouthampton is expected to reopen
OL,8,Fbefore the end of the year, the city
OL,9,Fcouncil has said.
OL,11,FContractor Morgan Sindall is completing
OL,12,Fthe "final touches" before the facility
OL,13,Fat Southampton Outdoor Sports Centre is
OL,14,Fhanded over to leisure operator BH
OL,15,FLive.
OL,17,FToqeer Kataria, Labour councillor
OL,18,Fresponsible for communities, safety and
OL,19,Fleisure, said the council was "still
OL,20,Fanticipating the centre will open by
OL,21,Fthe end of December".
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
